Preview 16 keeps native call identity local to each restricted invocation.
Later-response ID collisions are scoped consistently in calls/results without
weakening whole-batch validation, custom-provider IDs or callback ownership.
This shared SDK change adds no dependency, persistence, retry or app authority.

Derived from the Apache-2.0 AgInTiFlow restricted application SDK:
