Commit e4c16b0610c41e690d9288739561a5a7e187cc9d

The standalone extraction removes image handling and vision/provider imports,
accepts text-only input, and packages the bounded runner without dependencies.
The credential-text detector is retained unchanged. Preview 2 backports the
strict JSON parser and native metadata checks from AgInTiFlow commit
8dc44e691e61c2c23c8cc21d6aed26939d59c33e; the contract module matches that commit.
See README.md for the extraction boundary and qualification limits.

Preview 3 adds the explicit text-only DeepSeek profile and shared native-turn
admission checks from AgInTiFlow commit
6de9bb0b543613c4f01dfa29f6eebe520ab15de2. The factory/marker-guard block is kept
byte-identical to its qualified full SDK source; transport remains host-owned.

Preview 4 adds the shared explicit host-declared provider-failure channel and
monotonic exception-deadline correction from AgInTiFlow commit
18918723d3e68943e83ea22f45edeff3af1da5ba. The private in-process brand adds no
transport, retry, fallback, credential or application policy authority.

Preview 7 adds the matching explicit host-issued read-tool failure channel from
AgInTiFlow commit 8193dcf8fe1c30405a7325e8beeb5ddaaf201b09. It preserves the
existing stop/deadline/capacity rules and adds no HTTP classification, automatic
retry, provider fallback, source authentication or application activation.

Preview 11 ports the synchronous callback-result boxing fix from AgInTiFlow
commit ab912242200b6d0a73375de468aecbfd647d0b76. Strict JSON candidates are
validated without executing thenable hooks; genuine host Promise behavior and
cancellation accounting remain unchanged. No new import or dependency is added.

Preview 12 ports propagation-resistant native cancellation from AgInTiFlow
commit fe37b2cf761084499d6f64365f0aad1da8d34bbb. The runner and optional pinned
DeepSeek transport use Node's disposable abort subscription and preserve the
existing capacity/close accounting. The new node:events import is standard
library only; no package dependency, retry, fallback or app authority is added.

Preview 13 ports bounded uncertain HTTP retirement from AgInTiFlow commit
366c097f80d4d1e4d6b7a558ebdb3d37713f0598. Public failure and physical retirement
remain separate; a failed cleanup poisons admission, keeps exact physical work
tracked and preserves the cached failed close. No retry or dependency is added.
